WasmFS Node backend: chmod() and utimensat() never reach the host

Mode and time changes only updated WasmFS's own record. Give File setMode()
and setTimes() hooks, which the Node backend implements with Node's
(f)chmodSync and (f)utimesSync, through the open descriptor when there is
one; WasmFS's record changes only once the host's does, and host errors are
returned.

Upstream: not filed yet
Draft: docs/upstream/emscripten-wasmfs-node-chmod.md

